Package: BayesIRTplot
Title: Generate Plots for Bayesian Item Response Theory Models
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karina", "Cahill", email = "karina.cahill@asu.edu", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Roy", "Levy", email = "Roy.Levy@asu.edu", role = c("aut")),
    person("Yadi", "Li", email = "yadili@asu.edu", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Use for generating plots for Bayesian item response theory (IRT) models fitted in 'blavaan'. 
    Available plots include Item-Person Map (IPM), Item Characteristic Curve (ICC), Item Information Curve (IIC), Test
    Characteristic Curve (TCC), Test Information Curve (TIC), and Reliability Plot (REL).
